  "scope": "One adaptively selected pair of development residuals and a new exact projection/subsumption route. Two reversed repetitions per mode use independent identical seeds, twelve advances and one shared 32-state allowance. Both modes complete the same two targets; the union preserves the independent arm's extra work. Discovery checks all opposing pairs, exact order-preserving variable transport and retained subclauses for every deletion. Bounded exhaustive semantic tests cover formulas of at most three distinct clauses over three variables. Cold replay forbids new recognition and reference expansion; it checks both split branches, bridge dependencies, positive proofs, all reference nodes, repeated logical results, all original coverage flags and exact next selection. No arbitrary-renaming search, automatic target index, core recognizer policy change, new Lean formalization, fresh holdout, peak-RAM measurement, general minimum-cost claim or unrestricted-SAT bound.",
